{"3644140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Planet Chyton", "steam_appid": 3644140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644140/extras/49869d9ed01888082ad4a85dbd8e8a4a.poster.avif?t=1775216056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644140/extras/49869d9ed01888082ad4a85dbd8e8a4a.webm?t=1775216056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644140/extras/49869d9ed01888082ad4a85dbd8e8a4a.mp4?t=1775216056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you use a platform creating projectile to take on challenging platforming, fight a variety of enemy types, and explore dark colorful environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a small robot, sent down on an alien planet to aid the struggling astronaut colony against hostile alien species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644140/extras/d4ec926b142631ff8d85de4d080b8034.poster.avif?t=1775216056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644140/extras/d4ec926b142631ff8d85de4d080b8034.webm?t=1775216056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644140/extras/d4ec926b142631ff8d85de4d080b8034.mp4?t=1775216056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Platform creation mechanic where you strategically place platforms to navigate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Variety of Enemy types that are defeated through finding weakspots, or stomping them like in old classic platformers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dark but colorful biomes to explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644140/extras/49869d9ed01888082ad4a85dbd8e8a4a.poster.avif?t=1775216056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644140/extras/49869d9ed01888082ad4a85dbd8e8a4a.webm?t=1775216056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644140/extras/49869d9ed01888082ad4a85dbd8e8a4a.mp4?t=1775216056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you use a platform creating projectile to take on challenging platforming, fight a variety of enemy types, and explore dark colorful environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a small robot, sent down on an alien planet to aid the struggling astronaut colony against hostile alien species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644140/